# The two run/data symlinks at the repo ROOT only:
#   runs -> ~/runs/franka-sonic     data -> ~/data/franka-sonic
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored `data` also matched
# `harness/data/`, which silently kept every converter/demo script in that
# directory out of git (AGENTS.md: code lives in harness/, data in run folders).
/runs
/data
*.log
__pycache__/
